  <item>
    <title>Vol.030 | 小小生活里拥抱大大的幸福</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ff642be1eb34a93912aaf9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ff642be1eb34a93912aaf9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 17:26:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>想见面聊聊，没见到面。那就开麦聊聊，聊聊最近的幸福小事~</span></p><p><span>聊故乡、童年、老友，也聊副业、感动、知足</span><br></p><p><span>本期奇思妙响：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> 回归幸福小事老栏目，好久不见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 蛙鸣、星空、清晨鸡叫，回到小时候</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 故乡春天，吃到想念已久的槐花</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> 婚礼拍摄见证幸福，偶遇88岁认真写祝福的爷爷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 小城也幸福：不必奔赴大城市，安稳生活同样闪光</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 老友重逢，被认真款待的友谊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">29:03</a> 年少友谊，不问成就，只是开心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 湘潭东山书院，人少景静的治愈旅行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1959">32:39</a> 沉浸式打卡只有河南·戏剧幻城</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 祝大家都能发现幸福、感受幸福</span><br></p><p><span>🎙本期主播：红红＆Cc</span></p><p><span>✂剪辑：Cc</span></p><p><span>🎬本期Bgm：《一年又一年》只有河南主题曲</span></p><p><span>「一步一响收听平台」</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 网易云音乐 | QQ音乐 | 蜻蜓FM | 豆瓣 | 荔枝播客</span></p><p><br></p><p></p>]]></description>
